<title>NETHERLANDS: Heineken opens 9.0 pct down after warning.</title>
<headline>Heineken opens 9.0 pct down after warning.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch brewer Heineken NV opened 32.70 guilders or nine percent lower on Friday at 330.00 guilders after it announced lower than expected first half profits and warned profit for the full year 1996 would lag 1995's.</p>
</text>
